'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page eight of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 8|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|60|notext}} and 40 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Scout}}

==Trivia==
Unlike other cape icons, the [[Judgment Day]] cape's Warbond model wears this helmet instead of the standard [[B-01 Tactical]]—see [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 6|page six]].

==Issues==
SC is generally the designation for armors with the Scout passive, not SA, which should be reserved for [[Servo-Assisted]] armors.

